    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Refunds requested and failed",
      "description": "Refunds requested along with a payment (refund.requested) by reason, and refunds the payment service reported as FAILED (refund.failed). Totals since each service started: a counter's first event creates its series at 1, so rate()/increase() would miss it at demo volumes.",
